# On-demand synced skill copies (never commit) — the transversal skills served by the
# agents-shared capability (pr-review, bugfix, ikanos-capability) are versioned once in the
# golden-repo-naftiko golden repo and fetched on demand via
# .github/instructions/agents-shared.instructions.md. Never commit these synced copies.
.agents/skills/pr-review/
.agents/skills/bugfix/
.agents/skills/ikanos-capability/

# ─── Local developer environment notes (machine-specific paths) ─────────────────
.env.local

# ─── Scratch / disposable working files (PR bodies, test downloads, etc.) ─────
# ─── Agent scratch / working files (PR bodies, diffs, findings, tool downloads) ───
# Kept inside the workspace per agents-shared/context/agent-universal.md
# ("Working directory — inside the workspace, never outside it"), never /tmp.
/.work/
